Z||000012||zeelebuba||10-12-2001||02:28 PM||||  I do that lots to. What i usally do if its no more than 1/4 down in hole is put a 3/8 nut on top and zap it with my mig. The weld wont stick to the cast unless you u get it really hot. <P>||||reg||1
Z||000013||87GTZ34||10-12-2001||05:23 PM||||Wow, they wanted $50???  My machine shop charges $10 to extract (bolt or easy out) and another $10 if they have to retap and put in a coil.  What a rip...||||reg||13
